# Touch this file to run .github/workflows/regenerate.yml on this branch.
#
# `workflow_dispatch` only appears for a workflow that already exists on the default branch, so
# until that file merges this is the only way to run it. Change anything here — a date, a line —
# and push; the job regenerates the detekt baseline and exports the current Room schema, then
# commits them back to the branch it ran on.
#
# It is not automatic on purpose: regenerating a detekt baseline accepts every violation that
# exists at that moment, so a job doing it unattended would absolve each new one silently.

